WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.733 --> 00:00:16.423
"See you tomorrow, Bobby!"

2
00:00:18.324 --> 00:00:21.506
Bobby watched his friends get into a car with their soccer gear.

3
00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:25.189
They were heading to their team's first game of the season.

4
00:00:25.209 --> 00:00:29.672
"Don't let the Panthers score any goals," Bobby called.

5
00:00:30.476 --> 00:00:32.117
"And remember to pass the ball!"

6
00:00:33.539 --> 00:00:36.421
As the car disappeared, Bobby let out a big sigh.

7
00:00:38.803 --> 00:00:41.845
Then he grabbed his crutches and started hopping through the hallway.

8
00:00:44.868 --> 00:00:47.390
In the gym Miss Shelly was putting food on a table.

9
00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:50.212
"Good!" Bobby thought.

10
00:00:52.194 --> 00:00:54.396
"Miss Shelly, are we cooking today?"

11
00:00:54.676 --> 00:00:55.216
he asked.

12
00:00:55.236 --> 00:00:59.360
"Miss Shelly has her chef hat on," Jason said.

13
00:01:00.192 --> 00:01:01.332
"That means we're cooking!"

14
00:01:01.352 --> 00:01:06.114
"We're making nutty sweeties today," Miss Shelly said.

15
00:01:06.134 --> 00:01:09.995
"Nutty sweeties?"

16
00:01:11.035 --> 00:01:11.975
Jason laughed.

17
00:01:11.995 --> 00:01:13.436
"That's a funny name."

18
00:01:14.696 --> 00:01:16.136
Bobby was looking at the table.

19
00:01:16.156 --> 00:01:19.437
"There are only a few ingredients," he said.

20
00:01:19.457 --> 00:01:22.118
"You're right," Miss Shelly said.

21
00:01:22.138 --> 00:01:26.119
"That's because these treats are very easy to make."

22
00:01:27.019 --> 00:01:29.660
Bobby also noticed a machine sitting on the table.

23
00:01:30.312 --> 00:01:31.093
"What's that?"

24
00:01:31.513 --> 00:01:32.073
he asked.

25
00:01:32.093 --> 00:01:36.115
"It's a mini food processor," Miss Shelly explained.

26
00:01:36.135 --> 00:01:39.797
"It will chop the fruit and nuts for us.

27
00:01:40.878 --> 00:01:42.679
It makes our work go more quickly."

28
00:01:42.699 --> 00:01:45.320
"That sounds good!"

29
00:01:45.701 --> 00:01:46.401
Bobby said.

30
00:01:47.101 --> 00:01:49.943
Cooking was fun, but sometimes it took a lot of time.

31
00:01:51.124 --> 00:01:53.605
Jason began reading the instructions out loud.

32
00:01:53.625 --> 00:01:58.688
"Step one: chop one-half cup of raisins."

33
00:02:01.196 --> 00:02:03.218
He measured and dumped in the raisins.

34
00:02:03.238 --> 00:02:06.260
"Now fire up the machine, Nina!"

35
00:02:07.701 --> 00:02:09.403
Nina pushed the button on the machine.

36
00:02:10.303 --> 00:02:12.545
Whirr! It made a loud sound.

37
00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:20.672
"Now we set the raisins aside and chop the mixed nuts," Nina said.

38
00:02:24.154 --> 00:02:26.096
Bobby scooped one-third cup nuts.

39
00:02:27.737 --> 00:02:30.900
Whirr! In a second all the nuts were chopped.

40
00:02:32.464 --> 00:02:33.885
"That was so fast!

41
00:02:34.185 --> 00:02:35.885
This machine is amazing!"

42
00:02:36.346 --> 00:02:36.906
He laughed.

43
00:02:44.869 --> 00:02:46.770
are the four tablespoons of melted butter."

44
00:02:47.871 --> 00:02:50.432
Ethan poured the butter into the large mixing bowl.

45
00:02:51.692 --> 00:02:54.833
Izzie stirred the chopped raisins, nuts, and butter together.

46
00:02:54.853 --> 00:03:00.616
"Some cooks use peanut butter instead of butter," Miss Shelly said.

47
00:03:01.592 --> 00:03:05.394
"Then the snacks would be called super nutty sweeties!"

48
00:03:05.774 --> 00:03:06.435
Nina said.

49
00:03:06.455 --> 00:03:12.058
"Now for the fun part—we roll the mixture into little balls."

50
00:03:13.038 --> 00:03:14.479
Jason held up a tray.

51
00:03:14.499 --> 00:03:17.461
"And then we roll them in shredded coconut."

52
00:03:18.261 --> 00:03:20.803
Bobby took some of the mixture and made a little ball.

53
00:03:23.784 --> 00:03:25.185
He rolled it in the coconut.

54
00:03:25.205 --> 00:03:30.468
"Cool. They look like snowy soccer balls."

55
00:03:33.132 --> 00:03:34.613
"Who wants to taste one?"

56
00:03:34.973 --> 00:03:35.954
Miss Shelly asked.

57
00:03:35.974 --> 00:03:41.518
"Me!" Everybody raised their hands and reached for a nutty sweetie.

58
00:03:41.538 --> 00:03:46.482
"Let's put the rest in the refrigerator for later," Miss Shelly said.

59
00:03:48.323 --> 00:03:49.384
Jason took a bite.

60
00:03:50.144 --> 00:03:51.725
"Mmm. Delicious."

61
00:03:53.567 --> 00:03:56.549
"Nutty sweeties would be great after a soccer game."

62
00:03:58.010 --> 00:04:01.072
Bobby sighed as he looked down at the long cast on his leg.

63
00:04:01.536 --> 00:04:03.298
"If I ever get to play again."

64
00:04:03.318 --> 00:04:07.641
"Hey, want to play soccer right now?"

65
00:04:07.941 --> 00:04:08.662
Ethan asked.

66
00:04:09.663 --> 00:04:11.184
"What? My leg.

67
00:04:11.544 --> 00:04:13.586
I can't Bobby looked up.

68
00:04:14.407 --> 00:04:17.689
On the table Ethan had made two little goals with paper cups.

69
00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:21.553
Then Jason crumpled up some paper to form a ball.

70
00:04:21.573 --> 00:04:24.415
"We can play table soccer, silly!"

71
00:04:24.435 --> 00:04:28.098
"Oh!" Bobby grinned.

72
00:04:28.118 --> 00:04:29.940
"Game on!"
